id: detect/picture-troubles
name: a missing, foreign, or too small picture is reported briefly and clearly
prose: A missing or unreadable file, a file that is not a JPEG picture, and a picture with a side shorter than two pixels — too small to search for a margin in — are each reported in one brief English line on stderr with exit code 1.
scope:
- main.go
- picture.go
- testdata/not-jpeg.txt
- testdata/tiny.jpg
covers:
- R1
rows:
- run: ./brim detect testdata/missing.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 1
- run: ./brim detect testdata/not-jpeg.txt
  expect:
    rc: 1
- run: ./brim detect testdata/tiny.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 1
